<div class="blurb">
<div class="header"><h1>bbsengine6</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<ul>
<li> AI</li>
<li> upgrade to psycopg3 (database adapter, python, threaded connection pooling)
<li> RBOC (role based access control) (database)</li>
<li> switches PEAR::MDB2 with PDO (database adapter, php)</li>
<li> uses php8.x and python3.x</li>
<li> <code>\config</code> namespace for defines (php 5.3+)</li>
<li> groups database and session functions into their own namespace
<code>databaseconnect(SYSTEMDSN)</code> to
<code>\bbsengine6\database\connect(\config\SYSTEMDSN)</code> (php) <code>bbsengine6.database.connect()</code> (python)</li>
<li>named bound parameters instead of positional</li>
{*<li>calls to utility functions like getcurrenturi() become \bbsengine6\gertcurrenturi()</li>*}
<li>ttyio6 -> bbsengine6.io</li>
<li>getdate3 -> bbsengine6.input.getdate()</li>
{*<li>very modular (python and php) fe <code>bbsengine.database.connect()</code>,
<code>bbsengine.member.getcurrentmoniker()</code></li>*}
<li>reworked database constraints which referred to views</li>
<li>use smarty4</li>
<li>psycopg3 - threaded database abstraction layer</li>
<li>pl/pgsql</li>
<li>wcwidth</li>
</ul>
</div> {* body *}
</div> {* blurb *}

