<div class="blurb">
<div class="header"><h1>bbsengine4</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<ul>
<li>switched out <a href="http://pear.php.net/package/HTML_Page2/">PEAR::HTML_Page2</a> with use of "<a href="https://www.smarty.net/docs/en/advanced.features.template.inheritance.tpl">template inheritance</a>" in smarty3,
